WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:25.599
Kip still wanted to be good at something.

2
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.735
He got some of his acorns.

3
00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:32.582
"Watch this, Bird!" said Kip.

4
00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:36.371
He started to juggle the acorns.

5
00:00:36.372 --> 00:00:39.432
Plonk! Plip! Pling!

6
00:00:39.433 --> 00:00:43.044
One by one they fell down.

7
00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:45.344
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

8
00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.400
"You are so silly, Kip!"

9
00:00:48.401 --> 00:00:53.931
"I'm silly," said Kip.

10
00:00:53.932 --> 00:01:01.085
"But I'm not good at anything."

11
00:01:01.086 --> 00:01:04.237
Kip got his jump rope.

12
00:01:04.238 --> 00:01:08.932
"Watch this, Bird!" he said.

13
00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:14.703
Kip started to jump rope.

14
00:01:14.704 --> 00:01:19.340
But the rope got stuck on a branch.

15
00:01:19.341 --> 00:01:21.539
"Help!" said Kip.

16
00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.710
He swung around and around and around.

17
00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:28.492
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed again.

18
00:01:28.493 --> 00:01:31.725
"You are so silly, Kip!"

19
00:01:31.726 --> 00:01:34.333
"I'm silly," said Kip.

20
00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:37.786
"But I'm not good at anything!"

21
00:01:37.787 --> 00:01:41.004
Bird was quiet for a moment.

22
00:01:41.005 --> 00:01:44.279
"I just thought of something," she said.

23
00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:48.035
"Something you are very good at."

24
00:01:48.036 --> 00:01:51.077
"What am I good at?" asked Kip.

25
00:01:51.078 --> 00:01:57.839
"Making me laugh!" said Bird.
